      "sourceTextSha256": "a168e4ac7e707553dd0c6ccb0f1435e264afcbb8eca5d9099aa32c24af06e27d",
      "text": "Day 8 · An excursion to Trindade, a cove about 27 km from Paraty with ocean beaches and a natural pool in the sea, with guides specialised in the history, ecology and caiçara culture of the region. Stops at Praia do Cepilho, Praia dos Ranchos and Praia do Meio, where a trail of about 25 minutes through the Atlantic Forest leads to the Caixa d’Aço natural pool, a basin of rocks in the sea, perfect for swimming and snorkelling (an optional fisherman’s boat can be hired at Praia do Meio). Optional lunch at Praia dos Ranchos.",
      "provenance": {
